### TL;DR Code Snippet

```js
// One-liner you can drop into any MapLibre app
document.getElementById('myBtn').onclick = () => {
  map.flyTo({
    center: [lon, lat],   // target coordinates
    zoom: 13,             // desired zoom
    pitch: 45,            // optional tilt
    bearing: 30,          // optional rotation
    duration: 1500,       // ms
    // optional: easing: t => t*t   // custom curve
  });
};
```

That’s all you need to give users a buttery-smooth, cartographically sound camera transition. Happy mapping! 🚀
